                <p><strong>Minimum first-use path:</strong></p>
                <ol>
                    <li>Sign in.</li>
                    <li>Create <strong>Department</strong>, <strong>Room #</strong>, and <strong>Key Type</strong> in any order.</li>
                    <li>Create the first <strong>Workforce Member</strong> (no second person required).</li>
                    <li>Create a <strong>Work Assignment</strong> (member ↔ room) — required before Issue.</li>
                    <li>Create a <strong>KEY #</strong> (with Key Type) and assign <strong>Room #</strong> openings to that KEY #.</li>
                    <li>Register at least one <strong>MEDECO</strong> physical copy under that KEY #.</li>
