            <section id="key-rooms" class="help-section">
                <h3>Rooms opened by a KEY #</h3>
                <p>Record which Room # values a KEY # opens once, at the KEY # level. Every MEDECO copy under that KEY # opens the same rooms — copies do not carry independent room assignments.</p>
                <p>A <strong>master key</strong> is simply a KEY # associated with multiple rooms — no special hierarchy engine.</p>
                <div class="help-diagram-frame" role="img" aria-label="MASTER1 multi-room: one KEY # opens rooms 410D, 411A, 412B, and 420C">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 420 160" width="420" height="160" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
