                <figure class="help-figure">
                    <img class="help-shot" src="~/images/help/02-issue-key.png" alt="Issue Key form with key holder search, KEY # and MEDECO selection, derived rooms, and loan code field" />
                    <figcaption>Issue Key — deliberate holder and copy selection; rooms derived from KEY #.</figcaption>
                </figure>
                <div class="help-links"><a asp-page="/Operations/Issue">Issue Key</a></div>
            </section>

            <section id="current-custody" class="help-section">
                <h3>Active custody</h3>
                <p>See who holds which MEDECO copy. Active Loans lists every open issue with KEY #, MEDECO, holder, and times. Different MEDECO copies under the same KEY # can be issued simultaneously — each copy tracks its own custody.</p>
                <figure class="help-figure">
                    <img class="help-shot" src="~/images/help/03-active-loans.png" alt="Active Loans list showing issued KEY # and MEDECO pairs with current holders and due dates" />
                    <figcaption>Active Loans — open custody for each issued physical copy.</figcaption>
                </figure>
                <div class="help-links">
                    <a asp-page="/Operations/Active">Active Loans</a>
                    <a asp-page="/Operations/History">History</a>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="returning" class="help-section">
                <h3>Return a key</h3>
                <p>Complete return of the exact MEDECO copy that was issued. Other copies under the same KEY # are unaffected.</p>
                <ol class="help-steps">
                    <li>Open Receive Key with no active issue preselected (or open a specific issue from Active Loans).</li>
                    <li>Select the open issue labeled <strong>KEY # / MEDECO · holder — UIN</strong>.</li>
                    <li>Enter Receive reference and Received (operator local time).</li>
                    <li>Complete return — next Receive opens clean.</li>
                </ol>
                <div class="help-diagram-frame" role="img" aria-label="Return copy independence: returning MEDECO 26 leaves MEDECO 27 issued under KEY # 66800">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 420 130" width="420" height="130" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
